>
  <p>These terms apply to transfers and day tours booked through
    adelaideairporttobarossa.com.au. By lodging a booking request you agree to them.</p>

  <h2>Requests and confirmations</h2>
  <p>Submitting the form on this site is a <strong>request</strong>, not a confirmed booking, and no
    payment is taken at that point. Your booking exists once we reply in writing with a flat fare
    and pick-up details and you accept it.</p>

  <h2>Fares</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Fares are quoted as one flat price per car, one way, unless we say otherwise in writing.</li>
    <li>The fare we confirm in writing is the price you pay. There is no meter and no surge.</li>
    <li>Any fare estimator on this site is indicative only. The written quote is what counts.</li>
    <li>Extra stops, extra waiting time or a changed destination on the day may change the price;
      we will tell you before the extra cost is incurred wherever we can.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Payment</h2>
  <p class="note">[PAYMENT METHODS AND TIMING — owner to confirm. State which methods are accepted
    and whether payment is on the day or in advance.]</p>

  <h2>Flights, delays and waiting</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Give us your flight number and we track it, so your driver adjusts to the real landing time
      at no extra cost to you.</li>
    <li>If you cannot find your driver, call <a href="tel:+61447958346">0447 958 346</a> before
      leaving the terminal.</li>
    <li>If you do not arrive and do not contact us, the booking is treated as a no-show.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="note">[FREE WAITING TIME AND WAITING FEES — owner to confirm, e.g. 60 minutes free
    after landing, then a per-hour charge.]</p>

  <h2>Cancellations and changes</h2>
  <p class="note">[CANCELLATION POLICY — owner to confirm. State the notice period for a free
    cancellation and any fee that applies after it, plus the no-show charge.]</p>

  <h2>Passengers, luggage and child seats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Tell us passenger numbers and any oversized luggage when you book, so we send the right
      vehicle. We cannot carry more passengers or luggage than the vehicle is licensed for.</li>
    <li>Child seats are available on request. Tell us the ages of the children when you book.</li>
    <li>Seat belts must be worn. Smoking and vaping are not permitted in the vehicle.</li>
    <li>You are responsible for the cost of cleaning or repair if the vehicle is soiled or damaged
      during your trip.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Our liability</h2>
  <p>We take reasonable care to get you to your destination on time, but we are not liable for
    delays caused by traffic, weather, road closures, breakdowns or other events outside our
    control. Our services come with guarantees that cannot be excluded under the Australian
    Consumer Law. Nothing in these terms limits those rights.</p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the law of South Australia.</p>

